                                                "example_id": "f6b5bcd8-fa9d-451c-812e-f73c2bc09720",
                                                "sense_id": "c05f3e75-61fe-3a67-9b3e-ee2ebb24ff84",
                                                "text": "It’s fair to say that Wikipedia has spent far more time considering the philosophical ramifications of categorization than Aristotle and Kant ever did."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
